  "details": "I've set up a hinged physbone that's limited to 16.5 degrees of rotation. The plan was to use this as a slider/handle to control a parameter. I'm finding that this limit doesn't allow for a full range on the `{parameter}_Angle`. I'm stating the obvious here, but it would be great if that value was normalized relative to the maximum. (or had a checkbox to toggle normalization)\n\nAs it is, my 'hinged' physbone can only send `0.0-0.165` rather than `0.0-1.0`",
